"\n"
"An untrapped error occurred. Please file a bug report detailing the steps to "
"reproduce.\n"
msgstr "\nOcurrió un error no controlado. Reportá el bug detallando los pasos para reproducirlo.\n"

#: commands/cmdhandler.py:103
msgid ""
"\n"
"A cmdset merger-error occurred. This is often due to a syntax\n"
"error in one of the cmdsets to merge.\n"
msgstr "\nOcurrió un error al mezclar cmdsets. Suele deberse a un error de\nsintaxis en alguno de los cmdsets a mezclar.\n"

#: commands/cmdhandler.py:107
msgid ""
"\n"
"A cmdset merger-error occurred. Please file a bug report detailing the\n"
"steps to reproduce.\n"
msgstr "\nOcurrió un error al mezclar cmdsets. Reportá el bug detallando los\npasos para reproducirlo.\n"

#: commands/cmdhandler.py:114
msgid ""
"\n"
"No command sets found! This is a critical bug that can have\n"
"multiple causes.\n"
msgstr "\nNo se encontró ningún cmdset. Es un bug crítico que puede tener\nvarias causas.\n"

#: commands/cmdhandler.py:118
msgid ""
"\n"
"No command sets found! This is a sign of a critical bug.  If\n"
"disconnecting/reconnecting doesn't\" solve the problem, try to contact\n"
"the server admin through\" some other means for assistance.\n"
msgstr "\nNo se encontró ningún cmdset. Es señal de un bug crítico. Si\ndesconectarte y volver a conectarte no lo soluciona, tratá de contactar\nal administrador del servidor por otra vía.\n"

#: commands/cmdhandler.py:126
msgid ""
"\n"
"A command handler bug occurred. If this is not due to a local change,\n"
"please file a bug report with the Evennia project, including the\n"
"traceback and steps to reproduce.\n"
msgstr "\nOcurrió un bug en el manejador de comandos. Si no viene de un cambio\nlocal, reportalo al proyecto Evennia incluyendo el traceback y los\npasos para reproducirlo.\n"

#: commands/cmdhandler.py:131
msgid ""
"\n"
"A command handler bug occurred. Please notify staff - they should\n"
"likely file a bug report with the Evennia project.\n"
msgstr "\nOcurrió un bug en el manejador de comandos. Avisale al staff: lo más\nprobable es que haya que reportarlo al proyecto Evennia.\n"

